      "created_at": "2020-10-18T12:23:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>How long do you typically play in one session and how many Action Scenes do you usually get in that time?</p>\n<p>We play for 3.5 to 5 hours and we only have time for one Action Scene in that time.&nbsp; We have plenty of goofing off and usually a lot of role-playing, but even so, our Action Scenes generally take a solid 2 to 2.5 hours.</p>",
