      "id": 233957,
      "name": "smashed247",
      "username": "smashed247",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/3d9bf3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-10-22T14:52:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My sessions are at most 3.5hrs long. At most each session consists of 1 social scene, 1 montage scene and 1 action scene. I try to make&nbsp;each collection 6 issues that could stand on their own but group together to form a longer narrative, however if during play-time&nbsp;looks like what I've planned for a issue won't fit in the session I'm learning to improvise and trim down to essentials and/or slip in what&nbsp;can't be cut into the start of the next issue/session.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
