      "created_at": "2020-11-24T15:16:31.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Only one of the preview package episodes took us more than 3.5 hours. Most of my own adventures were 1 session each, as well, with 3-4 action scenes persession, but very short transition scenes.It was 8 sessions for 6 episodes of my own, and 7 for the starter/preview kit.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>My players for SC tend not to be longwinded - they get straight to the description of what they're attempting, roll, then describe the result with very little waffling.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
